{"name": "Soulchain", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"124\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/c287e160d3e7071c95800bc0eff428fd.poster.avif?t=1787916068\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/c287e160d3e7071c95800bc0eff428fd.webm?t=1787916068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/c287e160d3e7071c95800bc0eff428fd.mp4?t=1787916068\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wake up as a lost little soul and find your place among the <i><strong>seasons of the Afterlife</strong></i> by using your soul as a<i><strong> grappling hook</strong> </i>in this tight, physics-based <i><strong>platformer meets metroidvania</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"124\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/db23d87e181893706a4fe01dc1cfcff8.poster.avif?t=1787916068\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/db23d87e181893706a4fe01dc1cfcff8.webm?t=1787916068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/db23d87e181893706a4fe01dc1cfcff8.mp4?t=1787916068\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The grappling hook allows for careful and thoughtful movements as well as quick and risky tricks, creating a toolkit that feels deeply expressive from beginner to pro. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Swing </strong>your way through hundreds of hand-crafted platforming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master</strong> various area-specific mechanics, from moving platforms to portals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adjust </strong>the difficulty level through a series of assist options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenge </strong>yourself through the Night, a brutal parallel world only for the bravest little souls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"124\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/9d6bc435c6c8b4e18d1181fd6e7107b8.poster.avif?t=1787916068\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/9d6bc435c6c8b4e18d1181fd6e7107b8.webm?t=1787916068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/extras/9d6bc435c6c8b4e18d1181fd6e7107b8.mp4?t=1787916068\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Afterlife is a rich, non-linear world full of characters to meet and secrets to uncover. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore </strong>the seasons of the Afterlife in your own way in a world inspired by classic metroidvanias</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Learn </strong>the possibilities of the grappling hook and unlock areas <i>gated not by items, but by knowledge.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet </strong>a colorful cast of characters and help them through their journeys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find </strong>collectible lost souls hidden in every corner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Use your soul as a grappling hook in this tight, non-linear, physics-based platformer. Swing through hundreds of hand-crafted challenges, explore a vast world inspired by classic metroidvanias, and find your place within the seasons of the Afterlife.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383610/e78435f8104a2587b7210ff889cdb1ed66cfac52/header.jpg?t=1787916068", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Exploration", "Metroidvania", "Precision Platformer", "Puzzle Platformer", "Puzzle", "Platformer"], "developers": "moraguma", "publishers": "moraguma", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3383610", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "28 August 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/QHgLEvqNVDs", "first_seen": 1787868000.0, "review_rank": 26}